@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentId =
@reviewerId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Paste the created contentId into @contentId before submitting or approving review.

### Submit the content for review.
POST {{baseUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/submit-review
Accept: application/json

### Approve the reviewed content.
POST {{baseUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reviewerId": "{{reviewerId}}"
}
